    <briefdescription>
<para>Registry of pluggable WASM runtime backends. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Usage — registering a backend at startup: <programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>In<sp/>wasmtime_backend.cpp:</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="wasm__runtime__injector_8h_1a4bcf5fee10405d2f530f2be333dd3aec" kindref="member">THEMIS_REGISTER_WASM_RUNTIME</ref>(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;wasmtime&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>100,<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Bytecode<sp/>Alliance<sp/>Wasmtime&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>[]()<sp/>-&gt;<sp/>std::unique_ptr&lt;IWasmRuntime&gt;<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">return</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>std::make_unique&lt;WasmtimeRuntime&gt;();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>});</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Usage — creating a runtime in <ref refid="classthemis_1_1modules_1_1_wasm_plugin_sandbox" kindref="compound">WasmPluginSandbox</ref>: <programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>rt<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1modules_1_1_wasm_runtime_injector_1a9458c441b32932fbce23635395f76c18" kindref="member">WasmRuntimeInjector::create</ref>(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;wasmtime&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(!rt)<sp/>rt<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1modules_1_1_wasm_runtime_injector_1a9458c441b32932fbce23635395f76c18" kindref="member">WasmRuntimeInjector::create</ref>();<sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>auto-select</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">rt-&gt;instantiate(bytes,<sp/>host_fns,<sp/>64<sp/>*<sp/>1024<sp/>*<sp/>1024);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
